Message-ID: <yCmkwo_MfZQ.RCpQpNqtEAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <yCmkwo_MfZQ.cpIvHnAIEAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
References: <yCmkwo_MfZQ.cpIvHnAIEAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/yCmkwo_MfZQ/m/RCpQpNqtEAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,
I see two issues, both of which I think are fixed by the same fix:
1) you specify replicate but not group
2) besag cannot be a group model (I’m pretty sure)

Solution: make location the main model (besag), set group=week and the control.group model to “rw2”, and don’t use replicate.

Finn

